{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【Now新聞台】幻彩詠香江最後一晚在維港兩岸上演。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>匯演如常在晚上8時開始，今次特別加入煙火效果作告別，歷時10分鐘，吸引大批市民及旅客觀賞。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>幻彩詠香江自2004年起，每晚8時在維港兩岸的建築物投放互動燈光及播放音樂；2005年列入健力士世界紀錄，成為全球最大型燈光音樂匯演。取代幻彩詠香江的新光影項目，會在明年陸續推出。</p></div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:44:04.900111+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:21:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:36.367908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:36.367908+00:00","content_hash":"b09b464f6d0247fbd9a8fa687fd27370e82374546e46a8264ad835dfb2c14ab8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}